#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:4
msgid "Terraform"
msgstr "Terraform"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides Terraform integration as both a provisioning engine "
"and a management tool. The Tools-level Terraform features focus on state "
"management, drift detection, and operational commands for Terraform-"
"managed infrastructure within |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| proporciona integración con Terraform tanto como motor de "
"aprovisionamiento como herramienta de gestión. Las funciones de Terraform"
" a nivel de herramientas se centran en la gestión de estado, detección de"
" desfase y comandos operacionales para la infraestructura gestionada con "
"Terraform dentro de |morpheus|."

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:11
msgid ""
"Terraform state and operations are accessible from App and Instance "
"detail pages for resources provisioned using Terraform blueprints or "
"Terraform Instance Types."
msgstr ""
"El estado y las operaciones de Terraform son accesibles desde las páginas"
" de detalle de Aplicación e Instancia para recursos aprovisionados usando"
" blueprints de Terraform o Tipos de Instancia de Terraform."

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:14
msgid "Terraform State Management"
msgstr "Gestión de estado de Terraform"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:16
msgid ""
"|morpheus| stores and manages Terraform state for all Terraform-"
"provisioned resources:"
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| almacena y gestiona el estado de Terraform para todos los "
"recursos aprovisionados con Terraform:"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:19
msgid "State Storage"
msgstr "Almacenamiento de estado"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:21
msgid "Terraform state is stored within |morpheus| (no external backend required)"
msgstr ""
"El estado de Terraform se almacena dentro de |morpheus| (no se requiere "
"backend externo)"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:22
msgid "State is encrypted at rest in the |morpheus| database"
msgstr "El estado se cifra en reposo en la base de datos de |morpheus|"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:23
msgid "State versioning is maintained for rollback capability"
msgstr "Se mantiene el versionado de estado para capacidad de reversión"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:24
msgid "State can be viewed and edited from the App or Instance detail page"
msgstr ""
"El estado puede verse y editarse desde la página de detalle de Aplicación"
" o Instancia"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:27
msgid "Viewing State"
msgstr "Ver estado"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:29
msgid "To view the current Terraform state:"
msgstr "Para ver el estado actual de Terraform:"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:31 ../../tools/terraform.rst:63
msgid "Navigate to the App or Instance provisioned with Terraform"
msgstr "Navegue a la Aplicación o Instancia aprovisionada con Terraform"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:32
msgid "Select the **State** tab"
msgstr "Seleccione la pestaña **State**"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:33
msgid "The current state JSON is displayed with syntax highlighting"
msgstr "El JSON del estado actual se muestra con resaltado de sintaxis"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:36
msgid "Editing State"
msgstr "Editar estado"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:38
msgid "Warning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:38
msgid ""
"Editing Terraform state directly is an advanced operation that can cause "
"infrastructure inconsistencies. Only modify state when necessary (e.g., "
"importing existing resources, removing orphaned entries)."
msgstr ""
"Editing Terraform state directly es un advanced operation que puede cause"
" infrastructure inconsistencies. Only modify state cuando necessary "
"(e.g., importing existente resources, removing orphaned entries)."

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:40
msgid "To edit state:"
msgstr "Para editar el estado:"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:42
msgid "Navigate to the App or Instance **State** tab"
msgstr "Navegue a la pestaña **State** de la Aplicación o Instancia"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:43
msgid "Click :guilabel:`EDIT STATE`"
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`EDIT STATE`"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:44
msgid "Modify the state JSON as needed"
msgstr "Modifique el JSON del estado según sea necesario"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:45
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:47
msgid ""
"Role permission **Provisioning: State** with ``Full`` access is required "
"for state editing."
msgstr ""
"Se requiere el permiso de rol **Provisioning: State** con acceso ``Full``"
" para la edición de estado."

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:50
msgid "Drift Detection"
msgstr "Detección de desfase"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:52
msgid ""
"|morpheus| can detect drift between the declared Terraform configuration "
"and the actual infrastructure state:"
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| puede detectar desfase entre la configuración declarada de "
"Terraform y el estado real de la infraestructura:"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:54
msgid ""
"Drift is identified by running ``terraform plan`` against the current "
"state"
msgstr ""
"El desfase se identifica ejecutando ``terraform plan`` contra el estado "
"actual"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:55
msgid "Resources that have changed outside of Terraform management are flagged"
msgstr "Los recursos que han cambiado fuera de la gestión de Terraform se marcan"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:56
msgid ""
"Drift information helps identify configuration issues and unauthorized "
"changes"
msgstr ""
"Drift information helps identify configuration issues y unauthorized "
"changes"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:59
msgid "Running Terraform Commands"
msgstr "Ejecutar comandos de Terraform"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:61
msgid "From the App or Instance detail page, Terraform commands can be executed:"
msgstr ""
"Desde la página de detalle de Aplicación o Instancia, se pueden ejecutar "
"comandos de Terraform:"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:64
msgid "Open the **Console** or **Terraform** tab"
msgstr "Abra la pestaña **Console** o **Terraform**"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:65
msgid "Enter Terraform commands in the command field:"
msgstr "Ingrese comandos de Terraform en el campo de comando:"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:67
msgid "``plan`` — Preview changes without applying"
msgstr "``plan`` — Vista previa de cambios sin aplicar"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:68
msgid "``apply`` — Apply the current configuration"
msgstr "``apply`` — Apply el/la actual configuration"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:69
msgid "``destroy`` — Destroy managed resources"
msgstr "``destroy`` — Destruir recursos administrados"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:70
msgid "``refresh`` — Update state to match real infrastructure"
msgstr "``refresh`` — Update state a match real infrastructure"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:71
msgid "``output`` — Display output values"
msgstr "``output`` — Display output valores"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:72
msgid "``state list`` — List resources in state"
msgstr "``state lista`` — List resources in state"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:73
msgid "``state show <resource>`` — Show details of a specific resource"
msgstr "``state show <resource>`` — Show detalles of a specific resource"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:75
msgid "Click :guilabel:`EXECUTE`"
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`EXECUTE`"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:77
msgid "Command output is displayed in real-time and stored in execution history."
msgstr ""
"La salida del comando se muestra en tiempo real y se almacena en el "
"historial de ejecución."

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:79
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:79
msgid ""
"Terraform commands are prefixed with ``terraform`` automatically. Enter "
"only the subcommand (e.g., ``plan`` not ``terraform plan``)."
msgstr ""
"Terraform commands son prefixed con ``terraform`` automatically. Enter "
"solo el/la subcommand (e.g., ``plan`` no ``terraform plan``)."

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:82
msgid "Terraform Settings"
msgstr "Configuración de Terraform"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:84
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Global Terraform settings are configured in "
":menuselection:`Administration --> Settings --> Provisioning` "
"(Administration > Settings > Provisioning):"
msgstr ""
"Global Terraform settings están configurados in |AdmSetPro| "
"(Administration > Settings > Provisioning):"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:87
msgid "Terraform Runtime"
msgstr "Entorno de ejecución de Terraform"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:89
msgid ""
"**TERRAFORM RUNTIME:** Select the Terraform runtime version (e.g., "
"``1.5.x``, ``1.6.x``)"
msgstr ""
"**TERRAFORM RUNTIME:** Seleccione el Terraform runtime version (e.g., "
"``1.5.x``, ``1.6.x``)"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:90
msgid "This sets the default Terraform version used for new deployments"
msgstr ""
"Esto establece la versión predeterminada de Terraform usada para nuevos "
"despliegues"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:91
msgid ""
"Individual Apps/Instances may specify version constraints in their "
"configuration"
msgstr ""
"Individual Apps/Instancias may specify version constraints in their "
"configuration"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:94
msgid "State Backend"
msgstr "Backend de estado"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:96
msgid "By default, |morpheus| acts as the state backend"
msgstr "Por defecto, |morpheus| actúa como backend de estado"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:97
msgid ""
"Remote backends (S3, Azure Blob, GCS, Consul) can be configured in the "
"Terraform configuration files"
msgstr ""
"Remote backends (S3, Azure Blob, GCS, Consul) puede ser configured in the"
" Terraform configuration files"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:100
msgid "Terraform Providers"
msgstr "Proveedores de Terraform"

#: ../../tools/terraform.rst:102
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports all Terraform providers available in the Terraform "
"Registry. Provider plugins are downloaded automatically during "
"``terraform init`` based on the configuration's ``required_providers`` "
"block."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| supports all Terraform providers disponible en the Terraform "
"Registry. Provider plugins are downloaded automatically during "
"``terraform init`` based on the configuration's ``required_providers`` "
"block."

